5. Tech Insider — "NFL Betting Guide 2026" (weekly cycle: Mon–Wed sharp, Thu–Fri retail, <=4h pre-kickoff news moves; opener Sunday night/Mon).
6. OddsIndex best-time-to-bet guide ("prop line might not move for hours after news breaks").
7. Rotowire — injury reports Wed/Fri-by-4PM/Sat; inactives Fri–Sat.
8. Unabated / ESPN / SI — practice squad = 17 (1 Intl), 2 elevations/game, 3/player/season; trade deadline Week 9 Tuesday.
9. Covers — line movement continues up to kickoff; late inactives matter.

> Date reconciliation note: sources straddle 2025 (Aug 26, Nov 4) and 2026 (Aug 30, Nov 10)
> seasons. The **2026** numbers above are used throughout, sourced from NFL Football Operations'
> current "2026 Important Dates" page.
